        &lt;description&gt;Define a Technical Service to enhance visibility, management, and operational alignment between the SAP Business Application and its supporting servers to represent the supporting infrastructure underpinning SAP. To achieve this:&amp;#13;
Create a Technical Service named "SAP Server Support" to represent the server infrastructure supporting SAP.&amp;#13;
Define Technical Service Offerings to differentiate support levels:&amp;#13;
"SAP Prod Server Support" – high availability, 24/7 support.&amp;#13;
"SAP NonProd Server Support" – lower priority, business hours support.&amp;#13;
Create a Dynamic CI Group to automatically group all Windows servers hosting SAP instances.&amp;#13;
Ensure proper alignment using the correct CSDM relationships to establish structured dependencies between the Business Application, Technical Service, and Infrastructure CIs.&amp;#13;
&amp;#13;
KB:&amp;#13;
